* This file should be included before any source code or macro usage
*
* NOTE  NOTE  NOTE  NOTE  NOTE  NOTE  NOTE  NOTE  NOTE  NOTE  NOTE  NOTE



* System programmers note:  the sysptrs are defined as being main-line code
* pointers.  These can't be used during interrupt code.  Other than that,
* no promises regarding the usage of these for anything at all, so a JSR
* while using one of these is a dangerous thing to do
		BEGIN_ZPAGE
sysptr		.DS 2
sysptr2		.DS 2
sysptr3		.DS 2
		END_ZPAGE


